From 77e8292361d9ef68d4e16ff1c6c2b6b80a54dd76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jan 2025 14:40:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: st: Add D1 domain for STM32MP23 family

Add a new power domain D1 domain to manage device assigned to CA35
and working only in Run1, managed by CLUSTER_PD and CpuIdle,
but without limitation for wakeup for S2IDLE, managed by EXTI1
and RET_PD.

This patch also changes power domain label to lowercase.

Signed-off-by: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I69d937a929c3e745f9d11db74298f0e1d91f0c2b
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/434117
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
